---
id: KelolaHariLibur-BulkTambahHariLibur
title: Kelola Hari Libur - Bulk Tambah Hari Libur
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SA as Super Admin/HR
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as HolidayController :control
    participant H as Holiday Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    SA->>UI: Klik tombol "Tambah Bulk" atau "Import Excel"
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form upload file atau tabel input multiple
    SA->>UI: Upload file Excel atau input beberapa hari libur sekaligus
    UI->>C: POST /admin/holidays/bulk-create
    note over C: Validasi: format data, tanggal unik, tidak ada duplikasi
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>+H: Create multiple holidays dari array data
        H->>+DB: INSERT INTO holidays (date, name, type, created_by, created_at) VALUES (...), (...), ...
        DB-->>-H: Semua hari libur berhasil disimpan
        H-->>C: Array of new holiday instances
        C-->>UI: Response sukses dengan jumlah record yang ditambahkan
        UI-->>SA: Notifikasi: "X hari libur berhasil ditambahkan"
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error dengan detail error per record
        UI-->>SA: Tampilkan pesan error dan baris yang bermasalah
    end

